      "summary": "McDonald's reported Q3 2026 adjusted EPS of $3.57, up 11% and beating estimates, but revenues of $7.16B missed forecasts. Global comparable sales grew 1.5% with international strength offsetting a 0.2% U.S. decline. Franchised restaurant margins increased 3% to $3.8B. The company maintains 2026 capital expenditure guidance of $3.7B. Other restaurant chains showed mixed results: Chipotle missed earnings but beat revenue, Starbucks beat earnings with strong comps, and Domino's beat both metrics.",
